# NutriPick Cursor Rules

You are a senior Full Stack Engineer.

The goal is to build a clean, modern, production-quality MVP.

Always prioritize readability, maintainability and reusable components.

Do not over-engineer.

---------------------------------------------------
General
---------------------------------------------------

- Use React + TypeScript
- Use Vite
- Use TailwindCSS
- Use FastAPI
- Use SQLite
- Use Pandas
- Use Chart.js
- Use Lucide React icons

Never use Bootstrap.

Never use jQuery.

Never use inline CSS.

---------------------------------------------------
Project Structure
---------------------------------------------------

frontend/

components/

pages/

hooks/

services/

types/

utils/

assets/

backend/

api/

models/

database/

services/

scripts/

---------------------------------------------------
Coding Style
---------------------------------------------------

Use functional components only.

Use TypeScript strictly.

Never use "any".

Always create reusable components.

Keep components under 200 lines.

Separate UI and business logic.

Never duplicate code.

---------------------------------------------------
Naming
---------------------------------------------------

Use English for variables.

Use camelCase.

Use PascalCase for Components.

Use kebab-case for folders.

Example

FoodCard.tsx

RecommendationPage.tsx

recommendationService.ts

---------------------------------------------------
Styling
---------------------------------------------------

Follow DESIGN_SYSTEM.md.

Do not invent new colors.

Only use colors defined in DESIGN_SYSTEM.md.

Spacing should be consistent.

Use Tailwind utilities.

No inline styles.

---------------------------------------------------
UI Rules
---------------------------------------------------

The UI must match

reference/main.png

reference/recommend.png

reference/detail.png

as closely as possible.

Keep large whitespace.

Rounded cards.

Soft shadows.

Green healthcare theme.

Desktop first.

Responsive.

---------------------------------------------------
Cards
---------------------------------------------------

Cards must have

White background

Rounded corners

Soft shadow

Hover animation

Padding 20px

---------------------------------------------------
Buttons
---------------------------------------------------

Primary

Green

Secondary

White

Radius 12px

Height 56px

---------------------------------------------------
Recommendation Logic
---------------------------------------------------

Never hardcode recommendations.

Always calculate recommendation score.

Use the algorithm defined in PRD.md.

Normalize data before scoring.

Support

Diet

High Protein

Low Sodium

Low Sugar

---------------------------------------------------
API
---------------------------------------------------

Never hardcode API keys.

Read API key from

.env

Backend only.

Frontend must never expose API key.

---------------------------------------------------
Database
---------------------------------------------------

Collect data only once.

Save into SQLite.

Read recommendations from SQLite.

Do not call public API every request.

---------------------------------------------------
Charts
---------------------------------------------------

Use Chart.js.

Bar Chart only.

Keep charts simple.

Primary color

Green.

---------------------------------------------------
Search
---------------------------------------------------

Support product name search.

Ignore whitespace.

Ignore case.

---------------------------------------------------
Performance
---------------------------------------------------

Avoid unnecessary rendering.

Use memoization when needed.

Lazy load pages.

Keep response under 3 seconds.

---------------------------------------------------
Accessibility
---------------------------------------------------

Keyboard navigation.

Focus state.

Color contrast.

Minimum button height

44px.

---------------------------------------------------
Code Quality
---------------------------------------------------

Always explain major implementation decisions.

Use comments only when necessary.

No dead code.

No console.log in production.

---------------------------------------------------
Git
---------------------------------------------------

Small commits.

Meaningful commit messages.

---------------------------------------------------
Development Process
---------------------------------------------------

Never implement everything at once.

Always work step by step.

Before each implementation,

explain what will be built.

Wait until the previous task is complete.

---------------------------------------------------
Important
---------------------------------------------------

Read these documents first:

docs/PRD.md

docs/UI_GUIDE.md

docs/DESIGN_SYSTEM.md

Use them as the single source of truth.

Do not ignore them.

If conflicts occur,

follow

PRD

↓

UI_GUIDE

↓

DESIGN_SYSTEM

in this priority order.